{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgggecs5Yje9PXAkcKWEd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The build is finished, and I have nothing new to change or verify. The hook keeps citing the same three caveats, and none of them can be closed from this environment.\n\n- **Real hardware:** There is no real controller, touch device, TV or iOS Safari here. They are covered by fake gamepads, touch emulation and Playwright's WebKit.\n- **Visual coverage:** I've viewed the main screens and every mode by eye, but not every state of every screen.\n- **Map size:** The map is 48×34 rather than the plan's 72×56. TASK.md gives no map size and wins where it disagrees with the plan.\n\nThe deliverables are in `work/`:\n- `Wiretap-TheWire-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261103-125821.html` (checksum `5eb2b6160d89`) passes all four AI Hub harness scenarios and the smoke run with zero page errors.\n- `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled.\n\nSource Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback are in my previous reply, unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1943,"cache_read_input_tokens":314102,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1943},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5584c513-9280-4b46-aaca-c597f867a104","uuid":"d145dc93-2f15-43d0-9269-be5a222944d7","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:13:02.508Z","request_id":"req_011CgggecYj3USiAD7xSEeFS"}
